tton\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此处的 amenability 是集合论结构的谓词部分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 对载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的可顺从性；传递性等额外条件由使用它的结构定义另行给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"M,A,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}amenable\\text{-}structure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S(M,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nM\\in V\\land A\\subseteq M\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;(x\\cap A\\in M)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":835,"backlinks":[{"id":"d4768eaba2d6f60b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S$ (amenability predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2774","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md|58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":[]}